# Installed skill links (recreate with: node tools/install.mjs)
.agents/skills/
.claude/skills/

# Pre-refactor snapshots, superseded by the tracked sources
*.zip

# Vendor specification PDFs and their text extractions.
#
# These are working artifacts of the verification passes: the chapters are
# written and checked against them, but the documents themselves are Intel's
# and AMD's and carry their own terms. The README's position is that they are
# cited, never reproduced, and a 12.5 MB copy of the VT-d specification sitting
# in .scratch/ contradicted that for several commits.
#
# Re-fetch them locally instead; every chapter names the publication number and
# revision it was verified against.
*.pdf
.scratch/**/pdf/
